    {
      "data": {
        "type": "MESSAGE_TYPE_CAST_ADD",
        "fid": 2790,
        "timestamp": 182866556,
        "network": "FARCASTER_NETWORK_MAINNET",
        "castAddBody": {
          "embedsDeprecated": [],
          "mentions": [3, 37],
          "parentCastId": null,
          "parentUrl": null,
          "text": "One thing people need to realize is that decentralized social networks haven't worked yet.\n\nThat's the truth.\n\nFarcaster's interactions dropped by 90% after  sold it, down to fewer than 3k posts a day.\n\nLens has never really taken off and has been consistently declining, also hovering around a few thousand interactions a day.\n\nI really love these innovations and have always been an early adopter of both, but so far, they've failed.\n\nThere are, unironically, Telegram groups with more engagement than these platforms.\n\nSo having someone like  spending energy trying to make the protocol useful and help it grow is really awesome.\n\nWeb3 people love to engage in these philosophical debates about decentralization, but if no one uses it, it doesn't matter whether it's decentralized or not. It's just LARPing.\n\nFarcaster was dead.Now it's got another shot. If you're enthusiastic about decentralized socials, take advantage of this moment. Join NS or another client and use the momentum to your advantage.",
          "embeds": [
            {
              "url": "https://imagedelivery.net/BXluQx4ige9GuW0Ia56BHw/545ab0b9-082b-4635-5f66-1ad172302d00/original"
